   "explanation_uz": "<b>have got / has got — ega bo'lish</b>\n\n✅ I / you / we / they <b>have got</b> a car. (I've got)\n✅ He / she / it <b>has got</b> a dog. (She's got)\n\n<b>Sifat + ot:</b> sifat otdan OLDIN keladi: a <i>big</i> house, a <i>new</i> phone, an <i>old</i> car.\n\n<b>Tartibsiz ko'plik:</b> man → men · woman → women · child → children · person → people",
